            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most homes, the Filtrete MPR 1000 MERV 11 is the best furnace filter. It captures pet dander and fine dust without straining a typical system, is certified asthma and allergy friendly per its listing, and works with an app for change reminders. Choose MERV 13, like the Filtrete MPR 1900 or Aerostar, for allergies if your system can handle it."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
