          <a href="#airflow" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. MERV vs Airflow</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. The 7 Best Furnace Filters</a>
          <a href="#size" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Finding Your Size</a>
          <a href="#how-often" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. How Often to Change</a>
          <a href="#allergies-pets" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Allergies and Pets</a>
          <a href="#reusable" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Reusable vs Disposable</a>
          <a href="#install" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. How to Change It</a>
          <a href="#smoke-odor" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Smoke, Mold and Odors</a>
          <a href="#filter-types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Filter Types</a>
